    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>The Witch of Fern Island</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/63864d616cee37fa23a9528e1524cac4.avif?t=1725542943\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/11fb2a1285157b25f7928380aadc6b56.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/11fb2a1285157b25f7928380aadc6b56.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/11fb2a1285157b25f7928380aadc6b56.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your loyal bird partner, announces the arrival of the barge! All hands on board! When guests come to the Spooky Bay, you need to serve them!<br><br><strong>Barges coming from around the world</strong><br>All barges are different and provide their own rules. Learn the rules, overcome the obstacles between you and your guests to reach them.<br><br><strong>Comedy horror aesthetics</strong><br>Drawn from folklore, the grotesque creatures are divided into groups with unique traits. Each of them includes individuals with individual preferences and behaviors. Discover new recipes based on their special orders!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/0c29318a2dc3753c814d72cc5cd6bdae.avif?t=1725542943\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/9a5667445229221630eea727a5dbd08c.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/9a5667445229221630eea727a5dbd08c.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/9a5667445229221630eea727a5dbd08c.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chop, mix, cook! Reach highest possible dish quality to please the pickiest creatures!<br><br>Split the tasks among the team! A fast-paced gameplay will surely force a lot of exciting interactions with other players you can invite in! Thanks to funny interaction animations, you will always find the right way to rush those who are slacking off!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/8095658c87073404aed4aa88846e2600.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/8095658c87073404aed4aa88846e2600.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/8095658c87073404aed4aa88846e2600.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Absurdly weird animals and plants await all around the island! Peel off folds of meat from plants, catch flying leaflies and potato fairies, milk worms and listen to the soothing shrieks of noiseshrooms!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/eb6de17f3fea76323ccd74840bdee632.avif?t=1725542943\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/c2e5ab5cb8fff47d5ad16a5eb0a52e9a.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/c2e5ab5cb8fff47d5ad16a5eb0a52e9a.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/c2e5ab5cb8fff47d5ad16a5eb0a52e9a.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The conclusion of Fiesta is a rewarding experience. You can acquire better kitchenware, new clothes and decorations!<br><br><strong>Personalize your experience</strong><br>After each successful Fiesta, more and more furniture and decorations end up in your hands. Arrange the interior of the resort your way! Prepare rooms for guests to rent, meet their needs and reach the highest rating!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/63864d616cee37fa23a9528e1524cac4.avif?t=1725542943\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/11fb2a1285157b25f7928380aadc6b56.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/11fb2a1285157b25f7928380aadc6b56.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/11fb2a1285157b25f7928380aadc6b56.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your loyal bird partner, announces the arrival of the barge! All hands on board! When guests come to the Spooky Bay, you need to serve them!<br><br><strong>Barges coming from around the world</strong><br>All barges are different and provide their own rules. Learn the rules, overcome the obstacles between you and your guests to reach them.<br><br><strong>Comedy horror aesthetics</strong><br>Drawn from folklore, the grotesque creatures are divided into groups with unique traits. Each of them includes individuals with individual preferences and behaviors. Discover new recipes based on their special orders!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/0c29318a2dc3753c814d72cc5cd6bdae.avif?t=1725542943\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/9a5667445229221630eea727a5dbd08c.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/9a5667445229221630eea727a5dbd08c.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/9a5667445229221630eea727a5dbd08c.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chop, mix, cook! Reach highest possible dish quality to please the pickiest creatures!<br><br>Split the tasks among the team! A fast-paced gameplay will surely force a lot of exciting interactions with other players you can invite in! Thanks to funny interaction animations, you will always find the right way to rush those who are slacking off!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/8095658c87073404aed4aa88846e2600.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/8095658c87073404aed4aa88846e2600.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/8095658c87073404aed4aa88846e2600.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Absurdly weird animals and plants await all around the island! Peel off folds of meat from plants, catch flying leaflies and potato fairies, milk worms and listen to the soothing shrieks of noiseshrooms!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/eb6de17f3fea76323ccd74840bdee632.avif?t=1725542943\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/c2e5ab5cb8fff47d5ad16a5eb0a52e9a.poster.avif?t=1725542943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/c2e5ab5cb8fff47d5ad16a5eb0a52e9a.webm?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496220/extras/c2e5ab5cb8fff47d5ad16a5eb0a52e9a.mp4?t=1725542943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The conclusion of Fiesta is a rewarding experience. You can acquire better kitchenware, new clothes and decorations!<br><br><strong>Personalize your experience</strong><br>After each successful Fiesta, more and more furniture and decorations end up in your hands. Arrange the interior of the resort your way! Prepare rooms for guests to rent, meet their needs and reach the highest rating!",
    "short_description": "Spooky Bay is a fast-paced cooking game where you manage a resort for surreal horror creatures. Play solo or co-op with your friends to spice up your experience with an array of funny interactions! Prepare exquisite food and rooms for your guests, and when they arrive \u2013 quickly serve them!",
